        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[자유학기제의 철학적 기반 형성 가능성 탐색: 실존주의 철학과의 비교를 바탕으로]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[Feasibility exploration about philosophical base of the Semester of Free Learning: based on comparison to the philosophy of existentialism]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[Feasibility exploration about philosophical base of the Semester of Free Learning: based on comparison to the philosophy of existentialism]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
        <author-group>
          <author author-division="1" author-part="제1">
            <name><![CDATA[이재창]]></name>
            <name-eng><![CDATA[Lee Jae Chang]]></name-eng>
